// Build settings for the BabyBloom app target (wired in project.yml via
// `configFiles`). Committed, so it must never hold a secret: the repo is public.
//
// The Amplitude API key defaults to empty, and an empty key makes analytics a
// no-op — a fresh clone builds and runs without it. A local key goes in
// Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored, see Secrets.example.xcconfig); `#include?` is
// the OPTIONAL include, so a missing file is not an error. The default must
// stay ABOVE the include, or it would overwrite the key the include set.
AMPLITUDE_API_KEY =
#include? "Secrets.xcconfig"
